<%- include('partials/header',{title:'Development tracker'}) %><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">PROMISES · PROJECTS · DELIVERY</span><h1>Follow the work.<br><em>Ask what changed.</em></h1><p>Track reported public initiatives with a focus on implementation, costs, timelines and measurable outcomes.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="notice mb-4">This starter version contains a sample of reported initiatives, not a complete audit of government performance. Status labels describe available evidence, not an overall rating of any politician.</div><%- include('partials/development-gallery',{developmentGallery,compact:false}) %><% developments.forEach(d=>{ %><article class="development-card mb-3"><div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between gap-2"><span class="tag"><%= d.area %></span><span class="date-label"><%= d.date %></span></div><h2><%= d.title %></h2><p><%= d.summary %></p><div class="watch-box"><strong>Evidence to watch</strong><p><%= d.watch %></p></div><a class="text-link" href="<%= d.source %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read source ↗</a></article><% }) %><h2 class="mt-5">Suggested tracking fields</h2><div class="row g-3"><% [['Commitment','Original announcement, responsible ministry and public document.'],['Budget','Approved allocation, actual expenditure and funding source.'],['Delivery','Location, milestones, contractor, completion date and evidence.'],['Outcome','Who benefited, measured impact, maintenance and audit findings.']].forEach(x=>{ %><div class="col-sm-6 col-lg-3"><div class="question-card"><h3><%= x[0] %></h3><p><%= x[1] %></p></div></div><% }) %></div></div></section><%- include('partials/footer') %>
